{"schema_version":"talkami_spoken_audio_manifest_v2","theme_id":"04.04","status":"audio_not_recorded","main_count":58,"reply_count":22,"alternative_count":8,"total_audio_count":88,"audio_naming":"${id}.mp3","entries":[{"id":"04.04.01-S001","kind":"main","cn":"我们的菜呢？","meaning_my":"မှာထားတဲ့ ဟင်းတွေ ဘယ်ရောက်နေပြီလဲ။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"不好意思，我帮您问一下厨房。","meaning_my":"တောင်းပန်ပါတယ်၊ မီးဖိုချောင်မှာ မေးပေးပါမယ်။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S002","kind":"main","cn":"这道菜还要多久？","meaning_my":"ဒီဟင်း နောက်ထပ် ဘယ်လောက်ကြာမလဲ။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S002_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"大概还要五分钟。","meaning_my":"နောက်ထပ် ငါးမိနစ်လောက် ကြာမယ်။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S002_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S003","kind":"main","cn":"是不是漏单了？","meaning_my":"အော်ဒါကျန်ခဲ့တာလား။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我马上帮您查一下订单。","meaning_my":"အော်ဒါကို အခုချက်ချင်း စစ်ပေးပါမယ်။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S003_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"是不是漏了我们的单？","meaning_my":"အော်ဒါ ကျွန်တော်တို့ဟာ ကျန်ခဲ့တာလား။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S003_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S004","kind":"main","cn":"这道菜下单了吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီဟင်း အော်ဒါတင်ပြီးပြီလား။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S004_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我先帮您确认一下。","meaning_my":"အရင် စစ်ပေးပါမယ်။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S004_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S005","kind":"main","cn":"炒饭还没来。","meaning_my":"ထမင်းကြော် မရောက်သေးဘူး။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S006","kind":"main","cn":"还有一道没上。","meaning_my":"ဟင်းတစ်ပွဲ ကျန်သေးတယ်။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S007","kind":"main","cn":"我们等得有点久了。","meaning_my":"စောင့်ရတာ နည်းနည်း ကြာနေပြီ။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S007_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"实在不好意思，我再催一下。","meaning_my":"တကယ် တောင်းပန်ပါတယ်၊ နောက်တစ်ခါ ထပ်လိုက်မေးပေးပါမယ်။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S007_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S007_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"已经等很久了。","meaning_my":"အကြာကြီး စောင့်နေရပြီ။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S007_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S008","kind":"main","cn":"后面点的菜都上了。","meaning_my":"နောက်မှမှာထားတဲ့ ဟင်းတွေတောင် ရောက်နေပြီ။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S009","kind":"main","cn":"我们赶时间。","meaning_my":"အချိန်မရတော့ဘူး။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S010","kind":"main","cn":"能先上这道吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီဟင်းကို အရင် တင်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S010_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我去问问厨房能不能先上。","meaning_my":"အဲဒီဟင်းကို အရင်တင်ပေးလို့ရမရ မီးဖိုချောင်မှာ သွားမေးပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S010_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S011","kind":"main","cn":"这道菜还没开始做吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီဟင်းကို အခုထိ မချက်ရသေးဘူးလား။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.01-S012","kind":"main","cn":"饮料先上吧。","meaning_my":"သောက်စရာကို အရင် တင်ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"04.04.01-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S001","kind":"main","cn":"麻烦加点水。","meaning_my":"ရေ နည်းနည်း ထပ်ဖြည့်ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"要热水还是常温水？","meaning_my":"ရေနွေး လိုချင်လား၊ အခန်းအပူချိန်အတိုင်း ရေ လိုချင်လား။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S002","kind":"main","cn":"麻烦拿双筷子。","meaning_my":"တူတစ်စုံ ယူလာပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S002_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"再给我一双筷子。","meaning_my":"တူတစ်စုံ ထပ်ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S002_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S003","kind":"main","cn":"给我一个勺子。","meaning_my":"ဇွန်းတစ်ချောင်း ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S004","kind":"main","cn":"纸巾在哪里？","meaning_my":"တစ်ရှူး ဘယ်မှာလဲ။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S005","kind":"main","cn":"这个碗能换一下吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီပန်းကန်လုံးကို လဲပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S005_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可以，给您换一个干净的。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ သန့်တဲ့ပန်းကန်လုံးတစ်လုံး လဲပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S005_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S006","kind":"main","cn":"有公筷吗？","meaning_my":"ဟင်းခပ်ဖို့ သီးသန့်တူ ရှိလား။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S006_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"有，我给您拿一双夹菜用的。","meaning_my":"ရှိတယ်၊ ဟင်းခပ်ဖို့ တူတစ်စုံ ယူပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S006_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S006_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"有夹菜用的筷子吗？","meaning_my":"ဟင်းခပ်ဖို့ သီးသန့်တူ ရှိလား။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S006_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S007","kind":"main","cn":"再来一壶热水。","meaning_my":"ရေနွေး တစ်ကရား ထပ်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S008","kind":"main","cn":"能给我一把叉子吗？","meaning_my":"ခက်ရင်းတစ်ချောင်း ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S009","kind":"main","cn":"给我两个小碗。","meaning_my":"ပန်းကန်လုံးအသေး နှစ်လုံး ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S010","kind":"main","cn":"纸巾用完了。","meaning_my":"တစ်ရှူး ကုန်သွားပြီ။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S010_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我再拿一点过来。","meaning_my":"နည်းနည်း ထပ်ယူလာပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S010_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S011","kind":"main","cn":"我不太会用筷子。","meaning_my":"တူနဲ့စားတာ သိပ်မကျွမ်းဘူး။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S011_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"那我给您拿个叉子。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို ခက်ရင်းတစ်ချောင်း ယူပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S011_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S012","kind":"main","cn":"麻烦拿个空盘子。","meaning_my":"ပန်းကန်ပြားအလွတ် တစ်ချပ် ယူလာပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S013","kind":"main","cn":"能帮我加点热水吗？","meaning_my":"ရေနွေး နည်းနည်း ထပ်ဖြည့်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S014","kind":"main","cn":"能给我一个干净的杯子吗？","meaning_my":"သန့်တဲ့ခွက် တစ်ခွက် ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S015","kind":"main","cn":"有一次性筷子吗？","meaning_my":"တစ်ခါသုံးတူ ရှိလား။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S016","kind":"main","cn":"筷子掉地上了，麻烦换一双。","meaning_my":"တူ ကြမ်းပေါ် ကျသွားလို့ နောက်တစ်စုံ လဲပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S016_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好的，我拿一双新的来。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်ကဲ့၊ တူအသစ်တစ်စုံ ယူလာပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S016_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S016_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"筷子掉了，能换一双吗？","meaning_my":"တူ ကျသွားလို့ နောက်တစ်စုံ လဲပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.04.02-S016_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.04.02-S017","kind":"main","cn":"能再拿点纸巾吗？","meaning_my":"တစ်ရှူး နည်းနည်း ထပ်ယူလာပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_fil